MID_LGV_3_M06_Kai_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kai_m01_001: Things haven't always gone our way, but...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kai_m01_002: But we haven't run away from any of our troubles.\nThat's why we've been able to come this far.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kai_m01_003: I feel like you think about things the same way,\ndon't you, Promised One?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kai_m01_004: We aren't going to run away. We're going to defeat\nBalor. We have to.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Kai_m01: <BLN>We aren't running away!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bel_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bel_m01_001: Once again, the world has hope for the future—\nthanks to those who supported us.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bel_m01_002: To repay them, we must eliminate Balor and restore\ntrue peace.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bel_m01_003: And we will. You and I will guide the others.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Bel_m01: <BLN>We'll accomplish it.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dit_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dit_m01_001: I remember well the day I arrived in this land.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dit_m01_002: And since that day I have lived on. It is surprisingly\neasy both to live and to die.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dit_m01_003: Yes, life and death are simple things.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Dit_m01: <BLN>To live and to die...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tal_m01_001: My father solved so many of the world's mysteries,\nthey called him the Swashbuckler King.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tal_m01_002: Total jerk, right? He went and halved the fun for\nhis own son without a second thought!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tal_m01_003: But saving the world with you? He didn't do anything\nnearly as cool as that. Heh! I think that means I win.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Tal_m01: <BLN>This'll do it.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Orh_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Orh_m01_001: Both the living and the souls of the dead are\nequally precious.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Orh_m01_002: Yet, Balor toys with all of this as he pleases,\nusing his power to oppress everyone.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Orh_m01_003: This must be stopped. I will put the whole of my\nsoul into bringing an end to it.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Orh_m01: <BLN>This must be stopped.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Seo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Seo_m01_001: Our war with the underworld is starting to show\nsigns of ending.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Seo_m01_002: And I have endured this long without succumbing\nto the power of the arm.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Seo_m01_003: I will stay alongside you to the end. So long as I draw\nbreath, I will risk my soul to fight on.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Seo_m01: <BLN>I will fight by you to the end.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Led_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Led_m01_001: If the war were sung about by a bard, this would be\nthe most exciting part.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Led_m01_002: A throng of devotees gathered around their savior,\ndefying despair to reach a climactic conclusion...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Led_m01_003: Let's give this song a happy ending, shall we?\nThat'll make it more enjoyable to sing.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Led_m01: <BLN>The most exciting part.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Anh_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Anh_m01_001: I tried to read our fortune in regard to this war.\nBut I realized there's no need.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Anh_m01_002: No matter what hardships might be foretold, it's still\nup to us to cut a path that leads to the future.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Anh_m01_003: That holds true for everyone alive, don't you think,\nPromised One?
MID_LGA_3_M06_Anh_m01: <BLN>No need for fortune-telling.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tia_m01_001: So, this is it, is it? The decisive battle. I'm bringing\nall of my skill to bear.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tia_m01_002: Because I'm determined to see what comes next.\nWhat is life like after the world is at peace?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tia_m01_003: And I want to see it standing alongside you,\nPromised One!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Tia_m01: <BLN>So, this is it...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pet_m01_001: It's been a long time, huh? I finally feel like I won't\nhave to be scared anymore.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pet_m01_002: Everyone thinks we're going to die. But we're not,\nare we?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pet_m01_003: Come on, Promised One. Let's end this war.\nIf anyone can do it, we can.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Pet_m01: <BLN>It's been a long time...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hur_m01_001: Just a little further till we can attack Balor. I can't\nbelieve we're this close.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hur_m01_002: We'll march deep into the underworld, and we'll win.\nAfter that, we can all go home.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hur_m01_003: After all, you and I both have people waiting for us\nto return, don't we?
MID_LGA_3_M06_Hur_m01: <BLN>We can all go home...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Max_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Max_m01_001: Only one of the underworld gates remains. You did\nwell to bring us this far, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Max_m01_002: I'm glad I've been able to contribute how I can.\nCooking, sewing—oh, and fighting, of course!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Max_m01_003: I'll gladly throw away my life to save the world.\nJust say the word!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Max_m01: <BLN>At your command!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gol_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gol_m01_001: Gotta be honest. Since the world got all messed up,\nthere are some things that got easier.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gol_m01_002: I can rampage as much as I want, and folks are OK\nwith it! As long as it's against the risen dead.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gol_m01_003: But I guess, overall, I don't really like it? Everybody's\nworried they might die at any moment...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gol_m01_004: so, better that we beat these underworld guys and\nmake the world easier to live in.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Gol_m01: <BLN>It's waaay different!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gat_m01_001: I hear the soldiers saying it more and more—\nthat we are on the cusp of a new peace.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gat_m01_002: And I share their feelings. My excitement outweighs\nmy fear over what will come in this battle.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gat_m01_003: You can count on us, Promised One. We will fight\nfor this world, and for you.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Gat_m01: <BLN>You can count on us.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dan_m01_001: Soon, I shall watch the savior defeat Balor with my\nvery own eyes!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dan_m01_002: This war is like a play, and you its protagonist.\nWhich means you must defeat him in the last act!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dan_m01_003: And I look forward to that. As both a spectator\nwatching it, and the playwright who will record it.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Dan_m01: <BLN>I cannot contain my excitement!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fab_m01_001: What has happened in this land is a mere eyeblink\nfor one such as I.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fab_m01_002: And yet, I must laugh.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fab_m01_003: It has shaken the very foundations of my lifelong\nlearnings. How incredibly vexing.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Fab_m01: <BLN>I must laugh.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Esm_m01_001: If we defeat Balor, that's it, right?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Esm_m01_002: Seems like my mom's OK, so I wrote her a letter to\ntell her I'd come visit when this is all over.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Esm_m01_003: You'd better make it too. You're not allowed to\ndie, OK?
MID_LGA_3_M06_Esm_m01: <BLN>That's it, right?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Urs_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Urs_m01_001: I've never been very good at prayer. I tend to choose\nreality over hope.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Urs_m01_002: I figure, if wishes came true just by asking, we\nwouldn't be in this mess at all.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Urs_m01_003: Even so... I'll try praying anyway. We'll need all the\nhope we can get.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Urs_m01: <BLN>I'm not good at it, but I'll try.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sim_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sim_m01_001: Hey, you've checked your equipment, right? We need\nto be prepared before we take on Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sim_m01_002: But I probably don't need to remind you of something\nlike that. You ARE the Promised One, after all.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sim_m01_003: Still, lack of preparation means death. That's just\na fact.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Sim_m01: <BLN>You ready, Promised One?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lou_m01_001: It's finally time, Promised One. Next up is our fight\nwith Balor!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lou_m01_002: C'mon get pumped with me! Mmm-HA! Mmm-HA!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lou_m01_003: Yeah, that's it!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Lou_m01: <BLN>It's finally time!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fia_m01_001: ...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fia_m01_002: I prayed that the Promised One would bring us\nvictory, and here you are.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fia_m01_003: Healing and prayer... That's what I'm good at.\nSo I'll do it with all my heart!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Fia_m01: <BLN>...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Die_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Die_m01_001: Saving the world isn't really why I'm doing this.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Die_m01_002: I want to defeat Balor so I can come to terms with\nmy own past. That nightmarish ritual... 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Die_m01_003: That's why I'll fight with you until the ends of the\nunderworld.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Die_m01: <BLN>To the ends of the underworld...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lor_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lor_m01_001: The world is better than it was, but there are still\nmany people suffering from hunger.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lor_m01_002: I know that suffering. I was often hungry as a child.\nSo I'll be with you until the very end.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lor_m01_003: We've got to deliver on the promise of a bright\nfuture!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Lor_m01: <BLN>With you to the very end!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Set_m01_001: Hmm. What is it?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Set_m01_002: Do we have anything more to say—really? You and I\nrealize fully what's ahead. We fight for the world.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Set_m01_003: Heh...I hesitate to cut our talk short. But I will add\nthat I'm glad for our many conversations.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Set_m01: <BLN>What is it?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nin_m01_001: The time is near... Soon we break through the\nunderworld.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nin_m01_002: Fighting one of the Founders...the idea of that is\nscary.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nin_m01_003: But you are here, and so I know I will be fine. And\nknow...that I won't hesitate to kill Balor.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Nin_m01: <BLN>The time is near...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bon_m01_001: We are approaching the grand finale. The presence\nof death has never loomed larger.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bon_m01_002: I am an old man though, and have made my peace\nwith my imminent demise.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Bon_m01_003: So what is left to fear? If I must give my life in\nexchange for victory, I shall not hesitate.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Bon_m01: <BLN>We near the grand finale.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tob_m01_001: Awright! Victory's a stone's throw away!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tob_m01_002: We've come so far—now to keep pushing until we\nkick the big guy's butt!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tob_m01_003: Let's make it a contest. Between you and me, let's\nsee who's the one to take Balor's head. Baw haw!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Tob_m01: <BLN>Let's make it a contest!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lil_m01_001: Funny how it seems like it's been the blink of an eye\nbetween you showing up and now.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lil_m01_002: But I dunno, Promised One... You seem like you've\ngot this in the bag. What work's left for me to do?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lil_m01_003: Nah, I'm kidding. You know I'll stand with you all the\nway to the end.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Lil_m01: <BLN>You're gonna put me out of work.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lys_m01_001: Have I fought in a way that honors my late father\nand the uncle who raised me?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lys_m01_002: The question is premature. I should be asking these\nthings after we win back our peace.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Lys_m01_003: That day will come soon, Promised One. You have\nmy allegiance until the end.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Lys_m01: <BLN>Let us fight as one.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Buc_m01_001: You carry the world's hopes on your shoulders,\nPromised One. The people pray for your victory.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Buc_m01_002: For my part, I want to keep their hope alive by\nprotecting you to the last.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Buc_m01_003: All you need to do is keep moving forward—and let\nme strike down anyone in your way.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Buc_m01: <BLN>Onwards.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sci_m01_001: Shortly, we will arrive at Balor's doorstep and face\nthe god of the underworld!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sci_m01_002: If we were to defeat him and return home to tell\nthe tale, that would make for quite the epic.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sci_m01_003: Let's make sure we do—side by side. Alright,\nPromised One?
MID_LGA_3_M06_Sci_m01: <BLN>It would be quite the epic.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Moo_m01_001: At last, time for the final battle. I'm ready.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Moo_m01_002: We're not gonna lose. We're just a bunch of humans,\nbut we're gonna beat the god of the underworld.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Moo_m01_003: Let's show Balor that the living don't go down easy!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Moo_m01: <BLN>I'm ready!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mic_m01_001: So it was Balor's daughters who were behind all this?\nIt was all a plot for revenge?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mic_m01_002: And they're doing it all because they see it as their\nduty to their father? What a mess.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mic_m01_003: I don't know about you, Promised One, but I'd love\nto give that father of theirs a piece of my mind.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Mic_m01: <BLN>What a mess.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Oly_m01_001: Frankly, I do not consider Balor or his daughters to\nbe altogether evil.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Oly_m01_002: They wanted the world to look a certain way\nand worked toward that. Right?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Oly_m01_003: It's a sort of selfishness that—as much as it pains me\nto say so—I understand.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Oly_m01_004: But likewise, I will stride selfishly into battle, that we\nmay create a world where I thrive in my beauty!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Oly_m01: <BLN>I, too, am selfish.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Naz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Naz_m01_001: If I've learned anything these past few years, it's that\nthe power of the gods can change the whole world.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Naz_m01_002: Still, no matter how strong Balor thinks he is, we'll\nbe the ones still standing when it's all over!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Naz_m01_003: Let's do it, Promised One! No matter what,\nwe can't lose!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Naz_m01: <BLN>Let's do it, Promised One!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sar_m01_001: It's time, Promised One. Let's defeat Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sar_m01_002: This dark world isn't how we're meant to live.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sar_m01_003: People deserve the kind of hope I've felt while being\nwith you.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Sar_m01: <BLN>Let's defeat Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dai_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dai_m01_001: *sigh* I like going wild on the battlefield but, in the\nend, war gets so boring.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dai_m01_002: I wanna go wild when I feel like it, eat what I want,\nand sleep all I want.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dai_m01_003: Maybe Balor feels the same but, wow, he's just way\ntoo much trouble.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Dai_m01_004: I'm gonna teach him that troublemakers get what's\ncoming to them. No complaining, Balor!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Dai_m01: <BLN>I'll teach him!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hal_m01_001: Here, Promised One! I'll perform some of my tricks\nfor you. We need to have fun while we can.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hal_m01_002: It's gonna be time for our most difficult battle\nbefore long.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hal_m01_003: I want your mind and body to be in tip-top condition.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hal_m01_004: And I'm gonna do whatever it takes to make\nthat happen! I'm with you to the very end!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Hal_m01: <BLN>I'm with you to the very end!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Guj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Guj_m01_001: Now then, Promised One, it's about time that we\nteach Balor a lesson.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Guj_m01_002: Huh? A lesson in what, you say? I thought that\nwas obvious.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Guj_m01_003: That no one's going to tell everyone some big story\nabout ending the world—not on MY watch!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Guj_m01: <BLN>Telling big stories...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Yan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Yan_m01_001: The moment is close at hand when we must\nexorcise Balor from existence.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Yan_m01_002: He is unduly feared as a demon god. Balor is\nmerely another scoundrel!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Yan_m01_003: So, here we go! Let us bring this age of decay and\ndecline to an end—and save mankind!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Yan_m01: <BLN>Here we go!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Iio_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Iio_m01_001: The battles have been long and difficult, but it\nwasn't hard to summon the spirit to keep fighting.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Iio_m01_002: Those who are truly suffering are all those who have\nlost the will to keep up the fight.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Iio_m01_003: Let's end this suffering, Promised One. Everyone\nhas pinned their hopes on this.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Iio_m01: <BLN>Such long battles...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pep_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pep_m01_001: The spirits that reside in Dagda are giving their\nfull protection even now.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pep_m01_002: If they were not, how could we have possibly\nsurvived such a world.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Pep_m01_003: Offer your protection once more... Until Balor has\nbeen finally defeated...
MID_LGA_3_M06_Pep_m01: <BLN>The spirits give their protection.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Noc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Noc_m01_001: Now you can beat Balor at last, Luminous One!\nI'm sure that you'll win the day!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Noc_m01_002: My gut sense tells me it's true! I'm sure of it.\nI'm absolutely positive!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Noc_m01_003: Make him pay for destroying the world—the FULL\nprice and nothing less!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Noc_m01: <BLN>You'll win the day!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sop_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sop_m01_001: I can't believe that I survived this long. I worked in\nthe temples. Who knew I could be a good mercenary?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sop_m01_002: I guess things just work out sometimes. Let's keep\ngoing to the very end. Can't give up now!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Sop_m01_003: Let's win a big victory over Bally. And then, let's\ncelebrate with a banquet!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Sop_m01: <BLN>To the very end!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cat_m01_001: The end of this fight is finally in view. You and I\nboth produced so many military gains, naturally.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cat_m01_002: To conclude this campaign, we must do nothing\nless than defeat Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cat_m01_003: Catania will have saved the world, and then all will\nbe simply marvelous after that.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Cat_m01: <BLN>The end is in view.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ned_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ned_m01_001: Battle after battle, I've come to really feel how much\nstronger I've become.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ned_m01_002: I'm so different from who I once was. How much\nfurther can I go? I'll test myself against Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ned_m01_003: Let's go, Promised One. It's time.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Ned_m01: <BLN>Let's go.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Zac_m01_001: Hey, just how long do you plan on forcing me to\nfight? I'm at the end of my rope here!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Zac_m01_002: They call you Promised One, for gods' sake! So\nhurry up and bring light to the world already!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Zac_m01: <BLN>Hurry up! Save the world!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Maj_m01_001: Those stinkin' people from the Order of Mithras\nstarted this stupid war.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Maj_m01_002: So if we win now, I get to teach the ones who gave\nup on me a good lesson, right?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Maj_m01_003: They shoulda been worshipping me, the great\nMajide! Not some demon god!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Maj_m01: <BLN>Finally, I'll teach 'em.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ven_m01_001: I, General Benditz, won't die so easily! I may have\none foot in the grave. But the other foot is not!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ven_m01_002: I'm in charge of my life. I'll be damned if someone\nlike Balor thinks he can crush my dreams!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ven_m01_003: I'm not dying until I own a territory! And until my\nname goes down in history, even if it takes a century!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Ven_m01: <BLN>I won't die so easily!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ini_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ini_m01_001: I endured much from the Order of Mithras...those\nremains...the Divine Emperor...and Balor too.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ini_m01_002: I've been fighting through a lot for so long, for myself\nand everyone I know. And now...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ini_m01_003: Ach, I've gotta win this for Mom! For Dad! For ALL\nthe folks back home! Let's kick Balor in the teeth!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Ini_m01: <BLN>We really must win!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jas_m01_001: It feels like the end of our long battling is coming\npretty soon.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jas_m01_002: Making it this far...standing up to Balor...it's all\nthanks to you, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jas_m01_003: I met everyone dear to me in this land—my husband\nand so many others—so I must do my part to save it!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Jas_m01: <BLN>I'll protect this land!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ale_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ale_m01_001: I plan to return to the mansion where I once lived\nafter this war comes to a close.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ale_m01_002: I left the house empty because it reminded me of\nmy parents. I couldn't face those memories.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ale_m01_003: But after we beat Balor, I know I'll have the courage\nto go home again.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Ale_m01: <BLN>After this war comes to a close...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cen_m01_001: Promised One, if I may, I sometimes notice the \nmysterious looks you give Aurora.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cen_m01_002: Your actions are not out of religious devotion, like\nmine. It's more like you have a close relationship.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cen_m01_003: Make me a promise. Return home alive, for her sake.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cen_m01_004: I don't want to see her lose someone else precious\nto her.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Cen_m01: <BLN>Promised One...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kir_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kir_m01_001: Even if I die in this battle, it's been better than\nswinging from a rope.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kir_m01_002: They say that a pirate who does only bad in this\nworld will meet a miserable end.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kir_m01_003: Well, I don't intend to join the ghosts. So when all\nthis is over, I'll go back to pirating...peacefully.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Kir_m01: <BLN>Better than swinging from a rope!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nuz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nuz_m01_001: What I feel most now is...fear.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nuz_m01_002: Fear of facing the demon god, who is far more\nterrifying than Bahr Vahn ever was.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nuz_m01_003: But I can't let it paralyze me. For the sake of my\npeople—for everyone—I will do what must be done.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Nuz_m01: <BLN>I feel fear.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fot_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fot_m01_001: I've been surveying the city. Its people cling so\ndesperately to life.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fot_m01_002: Those who once abandoned all hope for life now look\nforward to tomorrow. You've given them solace.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fot_m01_003: They encourage one another to live to the fullest—\ndetermined to keep struggling unto the last.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Fot_m01_004: To live is an achingly beautiful thing.\nDon't you agree?
MID_LGA_3_M06_Fot_m01: <BLN>I was surveying the city.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kou_m01_001: We've fought side by side for so long. And as a result,\nI've been... Well, you saved me.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kou_m01_002: I'm starting to feel like I want to live to see the other\nside of this war.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kou_m01_003: It's a big change for me. I wouldn't be thinking this\nway if you hadn't given me a second chance at life.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kou_m01_004: I hope you'll take me into the final battle so that I\ncan repay that tremendous debt.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Kou_m01: <BLN>I owe you everything.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tro_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tro_m01_001: I haven't missed a step yet. I feel better than I have\nin a thousand years.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tro_m01_002: And I'm itching to land a hit on that damned Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tro_m01_003: You'd better not leave me behind because I'm old or\nany other such nonsense.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Tro_m01: <BLN>I'm still in top form.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Asw_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Asw_m01_001: Promised One. The final battle awaits. To win it,\nI am as ready to sacrifice my life as anyone.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Asw_m01_002: That said, I am intent not to die.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Asw_m01_003: There's someone who awaits my return.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Asw_m01_004: Whom...I also wish to return home with.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Asw_m01: <BLN>I will die if I must.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tah_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tah_m01_001: I'm sworn to protect Her Majesty, no matter the\ncircumstances.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tah_m01_002: If Balor threatens her—demon god or not—I'm not\ngoing to hold back.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tah_m01_003: I swear to protect you, no matter the circumstances.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Tah_m01_004: Her Majesty may be gone, but I know that that's\nwhat she would have wanted.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Tah_m01: <BLN>No matter what.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_001: I haven't been here long, but I already feel at home.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_002: No one here seems to treat outsiders like the Mosa\nany differently.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_003: Not even the folks from Saramis, our longtime\nsworn foes.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_004: <NCA>"That's good."
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_005: I wish I could agree. Unfortunately, I can't stay here.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_006: At the end of the day, I'm a general here as a guest.\nMy ultimate allegiance is still to King Oktar.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_007: If my king commanded it, we could easily be enemies\nagain the next time we meet.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Kra_m01_008: But until this war ends, my blade and my life are\nyours to use as you see fit.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Kra_m01: <BLN>I could get used to this.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nat_m01_001: Our war is in its final stages, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nat_m01_002: We're going to take out the evil god and make sure\nhumanity has a future...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Nat_m01_003: so, I guess we'd better get to it. You've got the\nCatoblepas of Arago on your side!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Nat_m01: <BLN>Final stages.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hri_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hri_m01_001: We've made it a long ways, and now we're battling\nfor the future of humanity.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hri_m01_002: I'll show up with all the resourcefulness and martial\nskill I have.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Hri_m01_003: Remember you've got the Pantere of Arago on\nyour side!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Hri_m01: <BLN>Made it this far.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ann_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ann_m01_001: It's finally time for the decisive battle! Do you have\nall the supplies you need?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ann_m01_002: You wouldn't want to be up against Balor wishing\nyou hadn't been so stingy, right?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Ann_m01_003: No reason to save your money now—go ahead and\nbuy out all my stock!
MID_LGA_3_M06_Ann_m01: <BLN>Do you have enough supplies?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mys_m01: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mys_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mys_m01_002: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mys_m01_003: 
MID_LGA_3_M06_Mys_m01: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cle_m01: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cle_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cle_m01_002: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cle_m01_003: 
MID_LGA_3_M06_Cle_m01: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gra_m01: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gra_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Gra_m01_002: 
MID_LGA_3_M06_Gra_m01: 
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jun_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jun_m01_001: Soon, the battle for the fate of the world will begin.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Jun_m01_002: I will pray to the great progenitor god that we\nemerge victorious.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Jun_m01: <BLN>I will pray for victory.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mar_m01_001: At last, the time has come. We're facing down\nBalor—challenging the leader of the empire...
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mar_m01_002: As you doubtless know, Balor is one of the seven\noldest Nabateans.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Mar_m01_003: The closest in our family to the progenitor god.\nDon't underestimate him.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Mar_m01: <BLN>Watch out.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Smi_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Smi_m01_001: The final showdown is near. Aren't you scared?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Smi_m01_002: Well, I am. Challenging a ruler of this potency isn't\nsomething that comes along every day.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Smi_m01: <BLN>Aren't you scared?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cla_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cla_m01_001: Have you noticed? Smiles have been returning to\nfaces all around the city, one at a time.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cla_m01_002: They all believe in you—that you'll defeat Balor and\nsave the entire world.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Cla_m01_003: Honestly, I'm somewhat jealous. I was never able to\nearn that sort of support from the people.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Cla_m01: <BLN>Have you noticed?
MID_LGV_3_M06_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Car_m01_001: Time to depart, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Car_m01_002: Defeat Balor. Bring the light back into this dark,\ndark world.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Car_m01: <BLN>Please.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_Aur_m01_001: Everyone who lives in this land is precious to me.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Aur_m01_002: You are precious as well, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_Aur_m01_003: So fight well, and don't allow yourself to lose to\nmy grandfather Balor!
MID_LGV_3_M06_Aur_m01_004: Come back unharmed. Please.
MID_LGA_3_M06_Aur_m01: <BLN>You mustn't lose!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B01_m01_001: Our citizen militia has grown much stronger. We\nmight be able to hold our own against the risen dead.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B01_m01_002: Don't worry about the people of Dagsion. We'll take\ncare of things here—you go defeat the demon god.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B01_m01: <BLN>We've grown much stronger.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B02_m01_001: Once this war is over, we're going to see to it that\nDagsion flourishes like never before.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B02_m01_002: Eventually we'd like to hold a festival on par with\nthe Heroic Games. That's still a long way off though.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B02_m01_003: Once you're back from beating Balor, maybe you can\ncontribute some ideas!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B02_m01: <BLN>Once this war is over...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B03_m01_001: When the demon god is no more, I'll be setting out to\ndo business in places the war kept me from going.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B03_m01_002: It'll be hard traveling on rough roads, but I aim to\ndeliver supplies to those in need. I'll do my best!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B03_m01: <BLN>When the demon god is no more...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B04_m01_001: Thanks for everything, Promised One! Portraits of\nyou are my hottest seller.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B04_m01_002: People say looking at your face gives them courage.\nIt's been years since I've had so many customers!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B04_m01: <BLN>Thank you for everything!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B05_m01_001: I've been too scared of the risen dead and the demon\ngod to sleep. Beat them up for me, OK?
MID_LGV_3_M06_B05_m01_002: I'll stay up waiting for you. I won't even take a nap!\nGood luck with the fight.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B05_m01: <BLN>I'm too scared to sleep...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B06_m01_001: Those who used to scoff at prayer are now flocking\nto the temples.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B06_m01_002: They come to pray for you, Promised One, and for\nthe world. I'm sure it's the same all over the land.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B06_m01_003: They believe wholeheartedly that you'll bring peace\nto us, and want to help even if they can't fight.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B06_m01: <BLN>Everyone is praying for you.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B07_m01_001: I've gathered as many people as I can who have\nsome skill with sacred magic.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B07_m01_002: We provide medical assistance to the wounded day\nand night. May fortune favor you in battle!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B07_m01: <BLN>May fortune favor you!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B08_m01_001: May all the gods bless you, Promised One. That's\nwhat we came to pray for.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B08_m01_002: So long as you live, all is not lost.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B08_m01: <BLN>May the gods bless you.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B09_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B09_m01_001: Once the demon god is defeated, I think you should\nrule the land of Dagda, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B09_m01_002: Then the whole world could be at peace again, just\nlike it was under Lord Solel.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B09_m01: <BLN>Once the demon god is defeated...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B10_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B10_m01_001: Ever since fleeing here to Dagsion, I've been drinking\nto avoid facing up to reality.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B10_m01_002: But I'm kicking the habit. Can't pray right if I'm\ndrunk, after all.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B10_m01: <BLN>I've been drinking to dull the pain.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B11_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B11_m01_001: What will happen to the land of Dagda if you lose?
MID_LGV_3_M06_B11_m01_002: I guess it'd be the end for all of us. Maybe it won't be\nso bad for us all to be risen dead together.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B11_m01: <BLN>If you lose...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B12_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B12_m01_001: Oh my! You're the Promised One! Cheers, and give\nthe demon god one for me!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B12_m01_002: If you win, we should get a bunch of food and drinks\nfrom all over the world to celebrate.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B12_m01: <BLN>Cheers!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B13_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B13_m01_001: Jehoshaphat's prophecies speak the truth! The\nPromised One will rid this world of darkness!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B13_m01_002: The dawn is near, my friends. We must only endure\nuntil then!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B13_m01: <BLN>The dawn is near!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B14_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B14_m01_001: My son was born after the war began. He's never\nknown what peace is like.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B14_m01_002: I dream of showing him someday. But it's up to you,\nPromised One...
MID_LGA_3_M06_B14_m01: <BLN>My poor son...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B15_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B15_m01_001: My mom told me to go see you and pray to you.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B15_m01_002: But isn't playing more fun than praying? I think so!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B15_m01: <BLN>You know...
MID_LGV_3_M06_B16_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B16_m01_001: Promised One...have you come for a last look at the\nlake before you go to face the demon god?
MID_LGV_3_M06_B16_m01_002: Be at ease. Even if you lose, it's hard to see how the\nworld could be worse off.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B16_m01: <BLN>Oh... Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B17_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B17_m01_001: The store I ran in my hometown went bankrupt, so\nI'm thinking of setting up shop here instead.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B17_m01_002: Which is why I need you to win. The future of this\nland is in your hands.
MID_LGA_3_M06_B17_m01: <BLN>It's all down to you.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B18_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B18_m01_001: I've gotten good at making prosthetic arms and legs.\nPeople know me for it now.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B18_m01_002: Even after you've brought an end to the war, I'm sure\nthere'll be lots for us artisans to do.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B18_m01_003: I'll keep honing my skills so I'm ready for that day!
MID_LGA_3_M06_B18_m01: <BLN>I'll do my part!
MID_LGV_3_M06_B19_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M06_B19_m01_001: Before, the people of Arago and Saramis could never\nhave seen eye to eye.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B19_m01_002: But all that's in the past. These days, we work closely\ntogether to host refugees in our state guesthouses.
MID_LGV_3_M06_B19_m01_003: I think we can do even more and join forces to build\na brighter future. Right, Promised One?
MID_LGA_3_M06_B19_m01: <BLN>We can build a brighter future.